        "code": {
          "text": "Bilateral exertional leg pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Crampy, heavy ache in both calves, possibly extending to the thighs; right worse than left. Comes on after a few minutes of walking (for example, walking from the train to school) and eases after a few minutes of rest. No nocturnal pain or rest pain. Onset is unclear: the patient alternately said last week and a few months ago."
      }
